<h1>Demand for Repair or Replacement under CRA 2015 s.23</h1><p>Take notice that the Apex UltraBook Pro 16 purchased on 14 January 2025 failed to conform to the statutory requirement of satisfactory quality under Consumer Rights Act 2015 s.9. Because the initial 30-day rejection period under s.22 has elapsed, the claimant hereby demands a repair or replacement pursuant to Section 23 of the Act.</p>